 packages/web/app/opengraph-image.png | Bin 0 -> 38082 bytes
 packages/web/app/opengraph-image.tsx | 167 ---------------------------
 packages/web/app/twitter-image.png   | Bin 0 -> 38082 bytes
 packages/web/app/twitter-image.tsx   | 167 ---------------------------
